# {{ name }}

Applet id: `{{ id }}`.

Requires Go. The SDK is the `sdk-go` module; run `go mod tidy` once to fetch it.

Run `glimpsectl applet run --dev .`: it loads `devconfig.toml` and attaches the
applet with its options and env. Options edits update it; source
edits restart it. Run `go vet ./...` to check it. The desktop entry runs `go run .`.

Add `center = ["{{ id }}"]` to a panel's applet zone.
